<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-31T00:55:30.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:55:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Afghan Taliban mortar fire and small-arms attacks on the northwest Pakistan border killed one civilian and wounded five, prompting the Pakistan army to strike Taliban positions, destroy border check posts and launch an operation against illegal Afghans in Peshawar. The Pakistani military expressed cautious optimism about renewed US-Iran mediation, warning that spoilers could undermine the process. Pakistan closed the Iran-Iraq land border for pilgrims and linked the closure to rising LPG prices, while China and Pakistan opened a green trade channel at the Sost-Khunjerab crossing. The conflict has resulted in 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/30/pakistan-army-cautiously-optimistic-about-us-iran-mediation-efforts?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE53T0FLRTlXTG1GU2x5TTU3ekNGQ3JxZGxobHB3ZXNySlhiaEpNczBrc3RjRUVrQmNHanF5Vjk2SE1GTTc2NUNkZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBSam1ZZTdlR2JzRUVRU19aa1k4STdMX2FkTDNEaDZFaGpkdGZIaElZbTZSNGlHTS1WblRGdUM4WDJVakNYRGhxRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE0wRWlTeTBSdkhQMk5EaVZfWXNRNzg1LUNKTFFLQjFsVmkyVmhycDhpM2tLZTEyS3k3TjNaOERpVXJQM1owbGVLQWF0MERhQTM4LVRQblVYa1BJbGZ1Y0xCbTFoa2lIS0JWc0cwZm15bEpWX1VDUXItcXR1WGo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Xinhua&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss